Detection: Password Spray via NTLM (Event 4776)
ATT&CK: T1110.003 - Brute Force: Password Spraying
```

index=endpoint EventCode=4776 earliest=-1h
| bin _time span=1m
| stats dc(Logon_Account) as unique_accounts, values(Logon_Account) as accounts by _time
| where unique_accounts > 3

```
Tune the threshold (currently > 3 distinct accounts per 1-minute window)
based on your environment's normal NTLM authentication volume.
